            "description": {
              "content": "Uploads a new custom TLS certificate. Uploading a new certificate automatically enables TLS for all domains listed as Subject Alternative Names (SAN entries) on the certificate. Certificate deployment takes approximately 20 minutes on average but may take up to an hour.",
